  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Signals Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Signal Project supports humanitarian actors delivering aid to the most vulnerable communities, in a fair and efficient manner and in the respect of do no harm. through logistics analysis and information management,  will encourage humanitarian organizations to include logistics vulnerability in the design of their intervention strategies and projects implementation. Intends to foster inclusion of logistically vulnerable populations in emergency preparedness and response plans and activities.</narrative>
  </description>
